<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua mucivali ua Paulu kuli Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tesa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu ua mucivali kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda uamucivali ua Tesalonika vausonekele kuli Kanganda Paulu (1: 1). Uasonekele ou mukanda munima ya Tesalonika uakulivanga, kusetekesa ha miaka yakupua makumi atanu naumo (51) munima ya kusemuka kua Kilistu. Paulu uakele mu Kolintu omo uasonekele ou mukanda ku cikungulukilo camu Tesalonika, cikungulukilo cije caputukile mu vungezi vuendi vua mu civali vua kutuala muzimbu uacili ua Njambi (Vilinga 17:1-10). Livulu lia Vilinga lihandeka ngualio, cikungulukilo vacipangelele Vayunda na Vangelengu vavengi. Cikungulukilo camu Tesalonika cahakele mana cikuma ha vintsimbu ya mamanusuililo na kuija kua Kilistu kua mucivali, omuo Paulu uasonekele viavingi mu mikanda yendi yoshe ku Tesalonika. Mbazuvuila ya mukanda ua Tesalonika ua mucivali ya kundamba kuvintsimbu via mamanusuililo. Paulu naua uananguile hakuluisa vilenda. Muntu uoshe napande kupanga cikuma ha via kulia viendi (3: 6-10).</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvanautumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">. Paulu uaputukile mu mukanda kulitumbula ikeye vavenia na vaje vanakele nakupanga navo (1: 1-2).</para>
  <para style="io1">. Kaha uatsantselele kuli Njambi ha cikungulukilo mu Tesalonika na kuvalombelela (1: 3-12).</para>
  <para style="io1">. Mu capita ya mucivali, Paulu ahandeka ha vintsimbu via mamanusuililo.</para>
  <para style="io1">. Kaha ahandeka hakuluisa vulenda na seho yakupanga cikuma (3: 1-15).</para>
  <para style="io1">. Paulu naua amanesa nakumeneka cikungulukilo (3: 16-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Kuhuminina kuli Paulu na Siluvanasi na Timateo. Kuli vantu vaku cikungulukilo ca mu Tesalonika, vaje vanakundama kuli Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Kaha Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu vamihane kavumbi na ciyulo.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusompa hakuija kua Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Vavusamba vetu tupande kutsantsela kuli Njambi ntsimbu yoshe omuo yeni. Eci cinapu cacili kuli yetu kulinga ngacije, omuo lutsilielo lueni luli nakukola cikuma na cizango cije muli naco kuli umo na mukuavo cili na kupua cakama cikuma. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Kaha omu mukemuo tulinakulihalesa hali yeni mu vikungulukilo via Njambi. Tulinakulihalesela ha lukakateya lueni nakutsiliela kueni mu mapakeso oshe aua na tuyando otu muli nakumona.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Kaha eci cinapu vukaleho ngeci kusompa ca Njambi cikeco ca vusunga, kaha mukapua vaka seho mu vumuene vuendi vuje vumulinakuyandela. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Njambi uapua uavusunga, kaha akaneha tuyando hali vaje valinakumiyandesa. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Kaha akamihuimisa yeni mulina kuyanda, kaha na kuli yetu naua. Akalinga evi omo Muene Yesu akasholoka kuhuma muilu na tungelo vendi va nzili, <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>hamo na milengi ya tuhia, nakuzangamesa vaje kuvatantekeya Njambi, na vaje kuvekuononoka Muzimbu Uacili ua Muene yetu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Kaha vakayanda mukuva zangamesa kua miaka yoshe, nakuvahangununa ku mesho a Muene naku vumpau vuendi vuakama, <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>kaha omo akeja ha litangua lije nakutambula vumpau kuli vantu vendi voshe vakulela nakalemeso kuli voshe vaje vanatsiliela. Neni naua mukakala hhakati kavo, omuo neni naua munatsiliela lizi lije tuamilekele.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Kaha omu mukemuo tukamilombelela ntsimbu yoshe. Tulinakulomba kuli Njambi yetu linga amipuise vaka seho ku muono uje uamisanene ngeci muyoyemo. Na nzili yendi yoshe ashulise vutumbe vueni vuoshe vuacili nakumanesa vipangi vieni via lutsilielo. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Mu ngila eyi vene lizina lia Muene yetu Yesu likatambula vumpau kuli yeni, neni naua kuli ikeye, ha kavumbi ka Njambi yetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yala uakuhona Kuononoka Lishiko lioshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Kuyongola hakuija ca Muene yetu Yesu Kilistu na hakukunguluka cetu linga tukale hamolika na ikeye, njimilomba vamuanetu nguange, <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>keti mukale na citanga mu vuasi mu visinganieka vieni cipue cishoti ku mutima ngueni Litangua lia Muene linahete. Omo vasinganieka ngeci tuahandekele eci omo tuambuluile vunanguizi cipue omo tuambuluile lizi, nge honi uje mukanda uahumine kuli. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Keti mutave umo amikuise mu ngila yeka naua kuahi. Omuo litangua lije kulikeja ngoco kuvanga noho kulitengulukila kua mamanusuililo kuneja na uje yala uakuhonoua kuononoka lishiko nasholoka, uje vemikile kuya ku mbulu ya tuhia. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Kaha ikeye akaluisa viuma vioshe vije vivahandeka nguavo vanjambi na cuma nkala civalemesa, akalihaka helu lia vioshe. Kaha naua akakovela nakutumama mu Njivo ya Njambi nakulitumbula ikeye vavenia nguendi Njambi.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Nkuma kumuasa kuanuka ndi? Njamilekele vioshe evi omo njakele hamo neni. <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Vuno honi kucili cuma cimo cilinakuvindika evi viuma ngeci keti vilingiue hano vene, kaha yeni muatantekeya ngueni cinapu cuma muka. Nankuma, omo ntsimbu ikapuamo amba honi akeje. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Vupi vuakukomouesa cikuma vuavushueke vulinakulingiua hano vene, vuno honi vije vilinakulingiua kuvikalingiua kuvanga noho uje muka kuvuvindika vanamuhumisa. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Kaha honi uje yala uakuhonoua kuononoka lishiko akasholoka, vuno honi omo Muene Yesu akeja, akamutsiha na mpunzi yakuhuma mu kanua nakumunongesa na vumpau vuendi. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Uje yala uakuhonoua kuononoka lishiko akeja na nzili ya Satana nakulinga vitantekeyeso na vikomoueso viakuliseza seza via makuli, <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>kaha akapangesa miyati yoshe yakapenga ya makuli hali vaje vakanonga. Vakevo vakanonga omuo kuvatambuile nakuzanga vusunga ngeci vovoke. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Nankuma, Njambi natumu nzili yakuvasevuisa linga ipange muli vakevo ngeci vatsiliele vije vinapu via makuli, <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>kaha linga voshe vaje kuvatsilielele vusunga, vuno honi vanakundama lika ku vupi, vakavahisa.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vanamihanguila ku Kuamena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Tunapande kutsantsela kuli Njambi ntsimbu yoshe hali yeni vakuetu, yeni vaje vazanga Muene. Omuo Njambi uamihanguile kupua vambangelo ku kuamena ha nzili ya Cimbembesi nakumipuisa vantu vendi vakulela, mu lutsilielo lueni lua vusunga. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Kaha Njambi uamisanene ngeci mulinge cuma eci ha Muzimbu Uacili ua vije vituambuluile kuli yeni, uamisanene ngeci mukahinge cihela ceni ca vumpau vua Muene yetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Ambahoni vamuanetu, imaneni ngoo nalukakateya ku vusunga vuje vutuamilongesele mukuambulula kuetu na mu mukanda uetu.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Honi Muene yetu Yesu Kilistu vavenia na Njambi Tatetu, uje uatuzangele na ku kavumbi kendi uatuhanene kutakama cije kucekutenguluka na kusimpa cakutsiliela. <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>Njambi amitakamese nakumikolesa mukupanga nakuhandeka vije vinapu viacili ntsimbu yoshe.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Tulombeleleniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Hakumanusuila vamuanetu, netu naua tulumbeleleniko linga lizi lia Muene liye kulutue nakushandoka vuasi vuasi linga valitambule nakalemeso, ngue muje mumualitambuile hhakati keni. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Kaha lombeleni naua linga Njambi atuohiele ku vantu va vupi, omuo keti ngue vantu voshe vanapu vaka kutsiliela ku lizi kuahi.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Vuno honi Muene uapua ua lutsilielo, kaha akamikolesa nakuminiunga kuli uje muka vupi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Kaha Muene natuhana kutsiliela muli yeni, kaha mua vusunga vene tunatsiliela nguetu mulinakutualelelaho kulinga vije vituamilekele linga muvilinge.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Kaha honi Muene atuamenene mitima yeni mukuvuisisa cizango ca Njambi na lukakateya luje luanamihana Kilistu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cinangulo ha Vulenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Mu lizina lia Muene Yesu Kilistu tulinakumishika, vaka kutsiliela litengeni ku voshe vantu vaje valinakuyoya yoyesi ya vulenda, vaje kuvekukavangeya vilongesa vije vituavahanene. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Yeni vavenia muatantekeya muacili ngueni munapande kupanga ngue muje mutuapangele yetu. Kutuakele na vulenda omo tuakele hamo neni. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Kutualile cuma ca muntu umo kuakuhona kufueta. Vuno honi tuatualeleleho kupanga vutsiki na mutania ngeci keti tumituike citele cimo. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Tualingile eci, keti ngue omuo kutuakele na nzili yakuyoyela ha viuma via vukuasi, vuno honi tuacilingile mukumimuesa ngila linga muyikave. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Ha ntsimbu ije omo tuakele hamo neni, tuakele nakumileka nguetu, “Uoshe aviana kupanga keti vamutavese kulia.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Tunahandeka eci omuo tonevu nguavo hhakati keni kuli vamo valinakuyoya yoyesi ya vulenda kaha vivalingevene viahi vuno honi vakundama lika mu vipangi via vakuavo. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Kaha mu lizina lia Muene Yesu Kilistu tulinakushika vantu ava nakuvanangula linga vapande kuyoya muacili nakulinga vipangi vije vivasa kuyoyela. <verse eid="2TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Vuno honi yeni vamuanetu, kumuapandele kuhona kulinga muacili. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Kaha hamo kuli yeni umo uje katondo kuononoka lizi lietu lije tuatumu kuli yeni mu mukanda ou. Kaha nga ngoco, mutaleni, kaha mushondolokeni linga shuamua imukole. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Keti mumupangese ngue napu citozi, vuno honi munanguleni lika ngue vaka kutsiliela.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mezi Akumanusuila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Kaha Muene vavenia, uje uapua ntsina ya ciyulo cetu, amihane ciyulo ha ntsimbu yoshe na mu vingila vioshe. Muene akale neni muva voshe.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Na livoko liange vavenia njasoneka nguange cihindu cakuhuma kuli yange Paulu. Eyi ikeyo ngila ya cimueso ca mikanda yange yoshe, omu mukemuo munjikasoneka.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Kavumbi ka Muene yetu Yesu Kilistu kakale neni voshe.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
